sequenceDiagram
  actor C as Customer
  participant API as Payment API
  participant PP as Payment Processing
  participant FE as Fees
  participant FR as Fraud Chain
  participant W as Wallet and Ledger
  participant BI as Biller Adapter
  participant B as Biller
  participant N as Notifications
  C->>API: POST /payments (Idempotency-Key, biller, fields, amount)
  API->>PP: createPayment
  PP->>PP: lookup idempotency key
  alt key already used
    PP-->>API: original result
    API-->>C: 200 original payment
  else new key
    PP->>BI: inquire(fields)
    BI->>B: bill inquiry
    B-->>BI: amount due
    BI-->>PP: BillInfo
    PP->>FE: calculate fee
    FE-->>PP: fee and total
    PP->>FR: run rules (limit, velocity, blocked)
    alt a rule fails
      FR-->>PP: rejected with reason
      PP-->>C: Rejected state, clear reason
    else rules pass
      PP->>W: hold total (atomic, row lock)
      alt insufficient funds
        W-->>PP: insufficient
        PP-->>C: Rejected state
      else held
        W-->>PP: FundsHeld
        PP->>BI: pay(reference)
        BI->>B: payment request
        alt confirmed
          B-->>BI: paid
          BI-->>PP: success
          PP->>W: convert hold to charge, credit fee income, agent commission
          PP-->>N: PaymentCompleted event
          N-->>C: SMS and push
        else refused
          B-->>BI: refused with code
          PP->>W: release hold
          PP-->>N: PaymentFailed event
          N-->>C: SMS with reason
        else timeout after 10 s
          PP->>PP: state Unknown, schedule re-queries
          PP-->>C: being processed
        end
      end
    end
  end
